    "body_html": "<p style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">The night victory became a legacy.</span></p>\n<p style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Drawn from the deep navy and fresh blue of the most recent campaign, 2026 captures a win that felt less like an arrival and more like confirmation. After the release of 2024, this was India returning under the weight of expectation and still playing like a team in control - defending the crown, owning the moment, and turning a great era into something larger.</span></p>\n<p style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">The cooler palette gives the watch a cleaner, more composed energy, confidence without the need to shout. 2026 is a tribute to the night India did not just win again. It defended, repeated, and turned belief into dynasty.</span></p>\n<p style=\"background: white;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">2026 is a limited edition of 100 pieces only.</span></b></p>"
