    "body_html": "<p style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">The night India exhaled.</span></p>\n<p style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Drawn from the blue and orange of modern Indian Cricket, 2024 captures the release of a victory that felt urgent, emotional, and long overdue. After years of coming close, the wait finally broke. The palette carries the energy of the era: intense, fearless, and impossible to look away from.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">More than a celebration of winning, 2024 is about pressure survived, belief repaid, and a final that reminded everyone why cricket still has the power to stop time.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; background: white;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">2024 is a limited edition of 100 pieces only.</span></b></p>"
