    "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">The night the wait finally ended.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Drawn from the blue and orange of that unforgettable campaign, 2011 carries the weight of a victory that meant more because of where it happened and how long it had been coming. Every detail speaks to a night that was emotional, pressurised, and impossible to forget - a captain\u2019s six into the Mumbai sky, a master finally lifted on the shoulders of his team.\u00a0</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">2011 is not just a winning year. It is the year a generation got the ending it had been dreaming of!<b></b></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">2011 is a limited edition of 100 pieces only.</span></b></p>"
