    "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">The night we found a new kind of swagger.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Drawn from the light blue and bold yellow of that era, 2007 captures a moment that felt young, unexpected, and completely electric. This was not just a victory - it was the beginning of a new chapter: a team playing with freedom, instinct, and nerve in a format that brought a different kind of pressure and a different kind of joy.\u00a0</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">The bright colour accents give the watch a more playful, high-energy character. 2007 is a tribute to the win that announced a new generation: fearless, fast, and impossible to ignore.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">2007 is a limited edition of 100 pieces only.</span></b></p>"
