    "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">The night we first learnt to believe.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Drawn from the deep navy and crisp whites of India\u2019s earliest victorious era, 1983 captures a moment before colour, spectacle, and superstardom fully took over the game. The restrained palette carries a vintage sporting character:\u00a0<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">\u00a0</span>disciplined, clean, and quietly defiant.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">1983 is a tribute to the underdog victory that became an origin story, the night Indian cricket stopped being hopeful and started becoming inevitable.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">1983 is a limited edition of 100 pieces only.</span></b></p>"
