    "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">Built around the slow, ancient power of the one-horned rhinoceros.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Drawn from Assam\u2019s Riverland, tall elephant grass, and the heavy quiet of the Brahmaputra Valley, Kaziranga Gorh sits in a landscape that feels old, wet, and alive. A deep green fume dial pulls from Kaziranga\u2019s floodplains \u2013 grass darkened by morning dew, forest edges, and river shadows. The black strap with green stitching gives it a sharper, more field-ready edge, like safari gear laid out before sunrise.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Rhino Hoof Prints move around the dial like heavy impressions in soft earth, hinting at an animal that has never needed to announce its power. Anchored to Assam through its Assamese numeral at 12 and the engraved state map on the caseback,\u00a0</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Kaziranga Gorh is a tribute to endurance, conservation, and the quiet majesty of a creature that seems to belong to another age.</span><b></b></span></span></p>"
