    "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">Built around the animal you almost never see coming.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Drawn from Rajasthan\u2019s granite hills, scrubland and the strange calm of leopard country, Jawai Tendua sits in a landscape where wilderness slips quietly into everyday life. A Dark Grey Fume Dial takes its cue from Jawai\u2019s stone outcrops at dusk: cool, watchful, almost still and the grey strap sharpens it with a nocturnal edge.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Leopard Paw Prints cross the dial like soft marks over rock and dust, suggesting an animal defined by stealth rather than spectacle. Anchored to Rajasthan through its Devanagari Numeral at 12 and the engraved state map on the case back, Jawai Tendua is a tribute to coexistence, camouflage, and the charged stillness of a place where the wild lives just beyond the village lights.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">The most understated watch in the collection because in Jawai, the most powerful presence is often the one you almost miss.</span></span></span></p>"
  },
