    "body_html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Drawn from Gujarat\u2019s dry teak forests, thorn scrub and sun-baked trails, Gir Sinh sits in a landscape that feels rugged, open, and quietly powerful. A Warm Brown Fume Dial pulls from Gir\u2019s earth, bark and late-afternoon light, while the brown strap carries the dusty practicality of the forest road.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break; box-sizing: border-box;\"><!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break; box-sizing: border-box;\"><!--[endif]--></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Lion Paw Prints move around the dial like heavy marks pressed into dry ground: unhurried, unhidden, and certain. </span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; background: white;\">\u00a0</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Anchored to Gujarat through its Gujarati Numeral at 12 and the engraved state map on the case back, </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Gir Sinh is a tribute to survival, pride, and the calm confidence of a creature that has never needed to chase attention.</span></p>"
