    "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">Built around the silence before the sighting.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Drawn from Rajasthan\u2019s dry forests, weathered stone forts and the held breath of tiger country, Ranthambore Bagh lives in a landscape where nothing announces itself too early. </span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">A Muted Olive Dial takes its cue from dhok scrub and shadowed trails. The Earthy Brown Strap brings in the dust, bark and trail-worn character of the terrain.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">Tiger Paw Prints circle the dial like signs left on a morning track, hinting at presence rather than revealing it outright. Anchored to Rajasthan through its Devanagari Numeral at 12 and the engraved state map on the case back, Ranthambore Bagh is a tribute to patience, instinct, and that rare moment when the forest suddenly comes alive.</span></span></span></p>"
