    "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">Nobody\u2019s stepping out for this one.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">The most unhurried expression of the Arka collection: a Rich Green Sunray Dial drawn from a monsoon afternoon, when the garden turns impossibly green and the rain is in no rush to clear. Warm Copper-Toned Bregnagari Numerals sit softly against the green, while the Konark Wheel Small Seconds turns at its own easy pace.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">A Dark Brown Alligator Textured Calf Leather Strap with subtle stitching keeps it warm, distinctive, and unbothered: made for a good book, a seat by the window, and nowhere else to be.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">It is not a day lost to the rain.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">It is a day reclaimed by it.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\"></span></p>"
