    "body_html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt; background: white;\">The calm of something steady, constant, and quietly always there.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">The most understated expression of the Arka collection is an Ivory Sunray Dial built around a steady, unbroken calm, the visual equivalent of a hum you stop noticing because it never leaves. Black Bregnagari Numerals create a quiet contrast, while a small Black Konark Wheel Small Seconds hand adds depth and rhythm to the dial.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">A Black Alligator Textured Calf Leather Strap keeps it clean, versatile, and quietly distinctive: a modern Indian dress watch built for the background of every day, not just its highlights.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; letter-spacing: .25pt;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">It is not the loudest color in the room.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; word-spacing: 0px;\">It is the one that's always been right.</span></span></span></p>"
